[7959]="70052643\n1\tComplete Filikul\030Complete The Vile Maw\030Complete Dâr Narbugud\030Complete Dark Delvings\030Complete Fil Gashan\030Complete Skûmfil\030Complete The Forges of Khazad-dûm\030Complete The Forgotten Treasury\030Complete The Grand Stair\030Complete The Sixteenth Hall\030Complete Halls of Crafting\030Complete The Mirror-halls of Lumul-nar\030Complete The Water Wheels: Nalâ-dûm\030Complete Library at Tham Mírdain\030Complete School at Tham Mírdain\030Complete The Battle of the Deep-way\030Complete Battle of the Way of Smiths\030Complete Battle of the Twenty-first Hall\030Complete Bult-kâr\030Complete Fulz-zahar\030Complete Mekeb-faham\030Complete Sejer-tharâkh\030Complete Tumun-ghâr\030Complete The Battle of Lórien\tComplete twelve quests and instances to aid those in Moria. Completing this quest will unlock Legendary Moria: Vanquishing the Deep (Advanced), and can be replayed weekly. This quest will be removed on the weekly reset time, and so must be completed weekly by that time.\n",
[7960]="70052641\n1\tComplete Filikul\030Complete The Vile Maw\030Complete Dâr Narbugud\030Complete Dark Delvings\030Complete Fil Gashan\030Complete Skûmfil\030Complete The Forges of Khazad-dûm\030Complete The Forgotten Treasury\030Complete The Grand Stair\030Complete The Sixteenth Hall\030Complete Halls of Crafting\030Complete The Mirror-halls of Lumul-nar\030Complete The Water Wheels: Nalâ-dûm\030Complete Library at Tham Mírdain\030Complete School at Tham Mírdain\030Complete The Battle of the Deep-way\030Complete Battle of the Way of Smiths\030Complete Battle of the Twenty-first Hall\030Complete Bult-kâr\030Complete Fulz-zahar\030Complete Mekeb-faham\030Complete Sejer-tharâkh\030Complete Tumun-ghâr\030Complete The Battle of Lórien\tComplete twelve quests and instances to aid those in Moria.\n",
[7961]="70019034\n1\tYou must complete Rilhathel's most legendary challenge during the Battle of Lórien\tRilhathel has asked you to not only successfully win the battle for Lórien, but to also defeat both Narshpug and Grakâmâb before they leave the field of battle, to prevent Belvagor from sustaining any serious wounds, and to do it all within thirty minutes.\n2\tSuccessfully complete the Battle of Lórien\030Defeat Narshpug\030Defeat Grakâmâb\tRilhathel has asked you to not only successfully win the battle for Lórien, but to also defeat both Narshpug and Grakâmâb before they leave the field of battle, to prevent Belvagor from sustaining any wounds, and to do it all within thirty minutes. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tTalk to Rilhathel at Caras Galadhon\tRilhathel is at Caras Galadhon, waiting to hear if you successfully completed his legendary challenge.\n",
[7962]="70062CD8\n1\tFind Rhawn's book\030Defeat ruffians in Radlaw (total: 6)\tRhawn needs help finding their lost tome. It should be in Radlaw in a location overlooking the Wadewater.\n2\tTalk to Rhawn Torlan\tYou have found Rhawn Torlan's lost tome. You should bring it back to Rhawn Torlan in Clegur.\n",
[7963]="70019D3A\n1\tBring packet of lembas to Losdirith\030Bring packet of lembas to Minathlang\tLosdirith is at the entrance to the garden of Lady Galadriel. Minathlang is at the entrance to the city. Basdan has given you packets of lembas to bring to the guards at various gates within the city.\n2\tTalk to Basdan upon Telain Bangad\tBasdan is on Telain Bangad in Caras Galadhon. You have delivered packets of lembas to the guards and should return now to Basdan.\n",
[7964]="7004E4F7\n1\tTalk to Tuhâl\tTuhâl seems to be unhappy with the task of recruiting more victims for the Jangovar. You should talk to Tuhâl.\n2\tWarn away Easterling refugees (total: 6)\tEasterling refugees can be found travelling into the Ironfold from Skald's Drop. You should warn Easterling refugees away from Utterby.\n3\tTalk to Yólkhon\tSpeak with Yólkhon. You should talk to Yólkhon, who can be found inside Utterby.\n",
[7965]="70016B5B\n1\tTell the story of the ancient battle\030Stand before the northern statue\030Stand before the southern fountain\030Stand before the central statue\tThere are three locations in Tharâkh Bazân, where Arnod wishes you to tell the story of the battles: a northern statue, a southern fountain, and a central statue. Arnod wants you to honour the fallen dwarves of Moria by telling the story of the ancient lost battle at the monuments the dwarves built in Tharâkh Bazân.\n2\tTalk to Arnod at Tharâkh Bazân\tArnod is at the eastern end of Tharâkh Bazân. Arnod will want to know that you honoured the ancients by telling the story of their defeat.\n",
[7966]="70054658\n1\tComplete 'The Harrowing of Morgul' on any difficulty\tComplete 'The Harrowing of Morgul' on any difficulty. Use the Instance Finder to enter this instance.\n2\tTalk to Damrod\tWith the defeat of both Shaktur and Dargásh in Zhar Dushgoi, the Rangers are able to reach deeper into Minas Morgul. You should speak to Damrod and inform him of your victory.\n",
[7967]="700529DA\n1\tRoar at a cowardly goblin at Evrul's Home\030Roar at a cowardly goblin at Gudule's Home\030Roar at a cowardly goblin at Hodver's Home\tCowardly goblins can be found in the forest near the Woodmen homes. Find them and roar at them!\n2\tTalk to Langhár\tLanghár can be summoned to your side with Langhár's summoning horn. You should talk to Langhár. If Langhár is no longer with you, she may be outside Waldfast or in Vegbár.\n",
[7968]="7001ABA1\n1\tComplete Maerwen's task\tThe Wargs and the foul meats they are fed with can be found at Draugdegil, north-east of Helethir. Maerwen has asked you to defeat the Wargs of Draugdegil, after tricking them into eating all of the goblins' foul meats.\n2\tTalk to Maerwen at Helethir\tMaerwen is at Helethir, south-west of Dol Guldur. You should return to Maerwen for your reward.\n",
